WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.127
Week 27: Present Subjunctive: Will and Emotion. recommend and request action express reaction state necessity without overclaiming certainty

2
00:00:10.127 --> 00:00:32.444
Read for the situation. Los residentes exigen que la ciudad repare el puente. La ingeniera recomienda que se cierre temporalmente y espera que el trabajo termine antes de la temporada de lluvias. The residents demand that the city repair the bridge. The engineer recommends closing it temporarily and hopes the work ends before the rainy season.

3
00:00:32.444 --> 00:00:41.185
Read again for evidence. Identify who acts, what changes, when it happens, and which words establish the relationship between events.

4
00:00:41.185 --> 00:00:48.731
Reading activities. Reading activity 64; Reading activity 65; Reading activity 66

5
00:00:48.731 --> 00:00:56.639
Retell. Without looking back, give the main idea, three supporting details, and one reasonable inference in Spanish.

6
00:00:56.639 --> 00:01:24.199
Model language. Recomiendo que revise los datos. — I recommend that you review the data. Es necesario que participen los vecinos. — It is necessary for the residents to participate. Me alegra que estés aquí. — I am glad you are here. El director pide que lleguemos temprano. — The director asks us to arrive early. Ojalá encuentren una solución justa. — I hope they find a fair solution.

7
00:01:24.199 --> 00:01:34.118
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
